# Paths that ripgrep-based search (and so most coding agents) skips. Git still tracks them;
# open them directly, or search with `rg --no-ignore`, when you actually need them.

# Curve-system prototype: holds stale, diverged copies of shipped code (route.ts, ink files).
/prototypes/

# Historical docs that no longer describe the site.
/docs/archive/

# Generated data: large and not meant to be read or edited by hand.
*.generated.json
